之就臧質，陳軍城南，玄謨留老弱守城，悉精兵接戰，賊遂大潰。加都督、前將軍，封曲江縣侯。中軍司馬劉沖之白孝武，言：「玄謨在梁山，與義宣通謀。」上意不能明，使有司奏玄謨多取寶貨，虛張戰簿，與徐州刺史垣護之並免官。","person_mention_id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws:p005:m0057"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-songshu-074-xuanmo-zangzhi:p001","text":"臧質字含文，東莞莒人。父熹字義和，武敬皇后弟也。與兄燾並好經籍。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":11,"last_line":11,"raw_start":189,"raw_end":221,"raw_character_offsets":[189,190,191,192,193,194,195,196,197,198,199,200,201,202,203,204,205,206,207,208,209,210,211,212,213,214,215,216,217,218,219,220],"revision_id":2118597},"mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-074-xuanmo-zangzhi:p001:m0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"臧質","kind":"person","person_id":"0zd_9uz_t7m_ABA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-074-xuanmo-zangzhi:p001:m0003","start":3,"end":5,"surface":"含文","kind":"person","person_id":"0zd_9uz_t7m_ABA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-074-xuanmo-zangzhi:p001:m0012","start":12,"end":13,"surface":"熹","kind":"person","person_id":"0zd_9uz_t7m_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-074-xuanmo-zangzhi:p001:m0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"義和","kind":"person","person_id":"0zd_9uz_t7m_AB","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-074-xuanmo-zangzhi:p001:m0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"燾","kind":"person","person_id":"fx3_a98_dj5","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-songshu-074-xuanmo-zangzhi","book_id":"b-songshu-074","work_id":"w-songshu","source_id":"s-songshu-074-xuanmo-zangzhi-ws2118597"},{"id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws:p005","text":"元凶弒立，玄謨為冀州刺史。孝武伐逆，玄謨遣濟南太守垣護之將兵赴義。事平，除徐州刺史，加都督。及南郡王義宣與江州刺史臧質反，朝庭假玄謨輔國將軍，拜豫州刺史，與柳元景南討，軍屯梁山，夾岸築偃月壘，水陸待之。義宣遣劉諶之就臧質，陳軍城南，玄謨留老弱守城，悉精兵接戰，賊遂大潰。加都督、前將軍，封曲江縣侯。中軍司馬劉沖之白孝武，言：「玄謨在梁山，與義宣通謀。」上意不能明，使有司奏玄謨多取寶貨，虛張戰簿，與徐州刺史垣護之並免官。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":44,"last_line":44,"raw_start":4274,"raw_end":4521,"raw_character_offsets":[4274,4275,4276,4277,4278,4279,4280,4281,4282,4283,4284,4285,4286,4324,4325,4326,4327,4328,4329,4330,4331,4332,4333,4334,4335,4336,4337,4338,4339,4340,4341,4342,4343,4344,4345,4346,4347,4348,4349,4350,4351,4352,4353,4354,4355,4356,4357,4358,4359,4360,4361,4362,4363,4364,4365,4366,4367,4368,4369,4370,4371,4372,4373,4374,4375,4376,4377,4378,4379,4380,4381,4382,4383,4384,4385,4386,4387,4388,4389,4390,4391,4392,4393,4394,4395,4396,4397,4398,4399,4400,4401,4402,4403,4404,4405,4406,4407,4408,4409,4410,4411,4412,4413,4414,4415,4416,4417,4418,4419,4420,4421,4422,4423,4424,4425,4426,4427,4428,4429,4430,4431,4432,4433,4434,4435,4436,4437,4438,4439,4440,4441,4442,4443,4444,4445,4446,4447,4448,4449,4450,4451,4452,4453,4454,4455,4456,4457,4458,4459,4460,4461,4462,4463,4464,4465,4466,4467,4468,4469,4470,4471,4472,4473,4474,4475,4476,4477,4478,4479,4480,4481,4482,4483,4484,4485,4486,4487,4488,4489,4490,4491,4492,4493,4494,4495,4496,4497,4498,4499,4500,4501,4502,4503,4504,4505,4506,4507,4508,4509,4510,4511,4512,4513,4514,4515,4516,4517,4518,4519,4520],"revision_id":1997726},"mentions":[{"id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws:p005:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"玄謨","kind":"person","person_id":"31b_fd1_f77","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws:p005:m0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"玄謨","kind":"person","person_id":"31b_fd1_f77","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws:p005:m0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"垣護之","kind":"person","person_id":"bdx_txf_e62_AA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-songshu-076-wangxuanmo-ws:p005:m0050","start":50,"end":52,"surface":"義宣","kind":"person","person_id":"9df_923_1a1","status":"